OL,3,GUK long range forecast
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Fri 16 Oct to Sun 25 Oct
OL,6,FSome rain at first across the far
OL,7,Fsoutheast of England on Friday, before
OL,8,Fhigh pressure brings settled and
OL,9,Fcooler weather through the weekend.
OL,10,FWinds will be mainly light, but could
OL,11,Fstill be breezy on some hills and
OL,12,Fcoasts. High pressure is also likely
OL,13,Fto hold on into the working week, with
OL,14,Ffair weather with variable cloud
OL,15,Famounts looking likely to prevail. Any
OL,16,Flow pressure systems running across
OL,17,Fthe North Atlantic will likely be
OL,18,Fblocked and deflected towards Iceland,
OL,19,Fbut some frontal incursions may make
OL,20,Fit through to bring some rain at times
OL,21,Fto parts of northern Britain.
OL,22,FTemperatures look to be around normal
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,23,Ffor the time of year, with foggy or
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
OL,24,Ffrosty mornings expected in the usual
OL,25,Fprone areas.
